BUG FIX 1: ReadOnly fields blocking submission
- All form fields are now editable for new documents
- Version field is only shown (disabled) in edit mode, not required
- No more readOnly+required conflict that prevented form submission
- Auto-filled values (version=1.0) are set on create, not enforced by UI lock

BUG FIX 2: Cannot edit Draft documents after saving
- Added Edit Document dialog for Draft-status documents
- 'Edit Document' option in dropdown menu (only for Draft docs)
- 'Edit Document / Modifier' button in detail view (only for Draft docs)
- Edit form is pre-filled with existing document data
- Users can save changes or save & submit for review

NEW: Level-driven conditional form sections
- N1: Regulatory Framework section (purple), management review note
- N2-N4: Parent Document required (with level hints)
- N4: Record Template section (amber) with:
  - Generates records toggle
  - Record lifecycle workflow selector
  - Auto-numbering format
  - ALCOA+ data integrity level
- Level indicator bar shows current level + description
- Collapsible sections with completion indicators

NEW: Level filter + clickable level cards
- Level filter dropdown in filter bar
- N1-N4 clickable summary cards (click to filter)
- Per-level document counts in summary section
